---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About AirbrushDOC — Expert Airbrush Reviews &amp; Tutorials"
  description="Learn about AirbrushDOC — honest airbrush equipment reviews, free tutorials, and a community dedicated to helping artists master airbrushing since 2010."
>
  <main class="about-page">

    <!-- ═══ HERO ═══ -->
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="about-hero-inner">
        <div class="about-hero-img-wrap">
          <img src="/images/airbrushdoc-avatar.webp" alt="AirbrushDOC founder" class="about-hero-img" />
        </div>
        <div class="about-hero-text">
          <div class="abd-hero-eyebrow about-eyebrow">✦ Airbrushing since 2010</div>
          <h1 class="about-hero-title">Hi, I'm the founder of <span class="about-accent">AirbrushDOC</span></h1>
          <p class="about-hero-sub">And I almost quit airbrushing before I really started — bad equipment, zero guidance, and a lot of wasted paint. This site exists so you don't have to go through the same.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ PERSONAL STORY ═══ -->
    <section class="about-section about-story">
      <div class="about-inner">
        <h2>How It All Started</h2>
        <p>My first airbrush experience was a disaster.</p>
        <p>I'd bought a $40 "complete airbrush kit" from eBay — you know the one. Comes in a plastic case, looks professional in photos, absolute garbage in reality. The compressor sounded like a chainsaw. The airbrush leaked more paint on my fingers than it sprayed on the canvas.</p>
        <p>After three frustrating hours and zero progress, I was ready to give up.</p>
        <blockquote class="about-quote">
          <p>A friend who'd been airbrushing for years came over, took one look at my setup, and said: <em>"Well, there's your problem."</em> He brought over his Iwata HP-C Plus and a proper compressor. Within 15 minutes, I was creating smooth gradients and controlled lines.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <p><strong>That's when I realized: it wasn't me. It was my equipment.</strong></p>
        <p>I'd wasted $40 and nearly quit an entire art form because I bought the wrong tools based on flashy marketing and low prices. I started AirbrushDOC so you wouldn't make the same mistake.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ WHY TRUST ═══ -->
    <section class="about-section about-trust">
      <div class="about-inner">
        <h2>Why Trust AirbrushDOC?</h2>
        <div class="about-pillars">
          <div class="about-pillar">
            <div class="about-pillar-icon">🧪</div>
            <h3>We Actually Test Everything</h3>
            <p>Every airbrush, compressor, and paint we recommend has been used — not for five minutes in a store but weeks or months of real-world work. Different paints, different surfaces, different techniques.</p>
            <p class="about-never-will"><span class="about-never">Never:</span> <em>"This looks good based on specs…"</em><br/><span class="about-will">Always:</span> <em>"After three months of daily use, here's what actually happened…"</em></p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-pillar">
            <div class="about-pillar-icon">🎯</div>
            <h3>We Don't Sugarcoat</h3>
            <p>If a popular airbrush has a flaw, I tell you. If a cheap compressor is actually decent for beginners, I'll say that too. My goal isn't to sell you the most expensive option — it's to help you buy the RIGHT one for your needs and budget.</p>
            <p>I've criticized products from brands that offer affiliate programs, because honesty matters more than commissions.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-pillar">
            <div class="about-pillar-icon">🤝</div>
            <h3>We're Part of the Community</h3>
            <p>This isn't a corporate blog churning out SEO content. I'm an active airbrush artist who participates in forums, responds to every comment and email, and continuously tests new techniques.</p>
            <p>When you ask a question, you're talking to an artist who's been in your exact situation — not a content writer reading from a script.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ JOURNEY TIMELINE ═══ -->
    <section class="about-section about-journey">
      <div class="about-inner">
        <h2>My Airbrush Journey</h2>
        <div class="about-timeline">
          <div class="about-tl-item">
            <div class="about-tl-year">2010–2012</div>
            <div class="about-tl-body">Started airbrushing as a hobby — model cars, custom helmets, canvas work. Learned mostly by trial, error, and expensive mistakes.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-tl-item">
            <div class="about-tl-year">2013–2015</div>
            <div class="about-tl-body">Moved into professional work: custom motorcycle tank art, commission pieces, and teaching friends who kept asking <em>"how do you do that?"</em></div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-tl-item">
            <div class="about-tl-year">2016</div>
            <div class="about-tl-body">Launched AirbrushDOC to document everything learned the hard way — equipment picks, technique guides, and the honest reviews nobody else was writing.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-tl-item">
            <div class="about-tl-year">2017–Now</div>
            <div class="about-tl-body">Tested over 50 airbrushes, 30 compressors, and hundreds of paint combinations. Published 100+ tutorials and guides. Helped thousands of artists find the right equipment.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ WHAT YOU'LL FIND ═══ -->
    <section class="about-section about-offers">
      <div class="about-inner">
        <h2>What AirbrushDOC Offers You</h2>
        <div class="about-offers-grid">
          <a href="/guides/" class="about-offer-card">
            <div class="about-offer-icon">📚</div>
            <h3>Comprehensive Guides</h3>
            <p>From "What is an airbrush?" to advanced multi-layer stenciling. Every guide is written in plain English with real photos.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/blog/?cat=reviews" class="about-offer-card">
            <div class="about-offer-icon">⭐</div>
            <h3>Honest Equipment Reviews</h3>
            <p>Iwata, Badger, Harder &amp; Steenbeck, Paasche, and yes — Chinese knockoffs too. Know what works before you spend a dime.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/blog/?cat=tutorials" class="about-offer-card">
            <div class="about-offer-icon">🎨</div>
            <h3>Free Tutorials &amp; Techniques</h3>
            <p>Step-by-step tutorials with photos and downloadable resources. Learn at your own pace, from basic to advanced.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/blog/?cat=stencils" class="about-offer-card">
            <div class="about-offer-icon">📐</div>
            <h3>Free Stencils</h3>
            <p>Hundreds of downloadable stencils for practice and projects — single-layer, multi-layer, skulls, flames, tribal, and more.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/tools/" class="about-offer-card">
            <div class="about-offer-icon">🔧</div>
            <h3>Interactive Tools</h3>
            <p>Airbrush finder quiz, troubleshooter, paint selector, and side-by-side model comparisons — all free, no signup needed.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/" class="about-offer-card">
            <div class="about-offer-icon">🛒</div>
            <h3>Curated Recommendations</h3>
            <p>Carefully selected equipment links that reflect the same standards used in reviews. Quality first, always.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ TESTIMONIALS ═══ -->
    <section class="about-section about-testimonials">
      <div class="about-inner">
        <h2>What Artists Are Saying</h2>
        <div class="about-testi-grid">
          <blockquote class="about-testi">
            <p>"It is good that you took the time to post a comprehensive listing of paint options. I wish more websites did so. The mainstream airbrush sites are sorely lacking on this point. Thanks!"</p>
            <cite>— Barry Munden</cite>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote class="about-testi">
            <p>"This is my second time at your site. And now I realize you have designed a great site to study and learn from."</p>
            <cite>— Larry Potillo</cite>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote class="about-testi">
            <p>"One of the biggest things for me was having Walkup's 93 year old nephew tell me that he was so pleased that his family could now be recognised for all their efforts. History made real!! Keep up the good work."</p>
            <cite>— Andy Penaluna</cite>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ TRANSPARENCY ═══ -->
    <section class="about-section about-transparency">
      <div class="about-inner">
        <h2>How AirbrushDOC Stays Free</h2>
        <p class="about-lead">Every tutorial, guide, and article on this site is free. Most stencils are free. Here's how we keep the lights on — with full transparency.</p>
        <div class="about-transp-grid">
          <div class="about-transp-item">
            <h3>Affiliate Partnerships</h3>
            <p>When you purchase equipment through links on this site, I earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. This helps cover hosting, equipment testing, and time creating content.</p>
            <p><strong>My promise:</strong> I only recommend products I've personally tested and believe in. If something is bad value, I'll say so — even if there's an affiliate program.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-transp-item">
            <h3>No Sponsored Posts</h3>
            <p>I don't accept payment for reviews or favorable coverage. Every opinion is my own, based on real testing and honest experience. Your trust matters more than any commission.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/" class="about-disclosure-link">Read the full Affiliate Disclosure →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ CTA ═══ -->
    <section class="about-section about-cta-section">
      <div class="about-inner">
        <h2>Ready to Master Airbrushing?</h2>
        <div class="about-cta-grid">
          <div class="about-cta-card">
            <h3>New to Airbrushing?</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><a href="/guides/">Browse the Beginner Guides</a></li>
              <li><a href="/tools/airbrush-quiz/">Find Your First Airbrush</a></li>
              <li><a href="/blog/?cat=stencils">Download Free Practice Stencils</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="about-cta-card">
            <h3>Choosing Equipment?</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><a href="/tools/compare/">Compare Airbrush Models</a></li>
              <li><a href="/tools/airbrush-quiz/">Airbrush Finder Quiz</a></li>
              <li><a href="/blog/?cat=reviews">Read Equipment Reviews</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="about-cta-card">
            <h3>Need Help?</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><a href="/tools/troubleshooter/">Airbrush Troubleshooter</a></li>
              <li><a href="/blog/?cat=tutorials">Browse Tutorials</a></li>
              <li><a href="/contact/">Get in Touch</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ CONTACT + NEWSLETTER ═══ -->
    <section class="about-section about-contact">
      <div class="about-inner about-contact-inner">
        <div class="about-contact-left">
          <h2>Questions? I'm Here.</h2>
          <p>Whether you're choosing your first airbrush, troubleshooting a technique, or just want to share your work — I read and respond to every message.</p>
          <div class="about-contact-detail">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
            <a href="mailto:contact@airbrushdoc.com">contact@airbrushdoc.com</a>
          </div>
          <p class="about-response">Usually within 24 hours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-contact-right">
          <h2>Get Weekly Airbrush Tips</h2>
          <p>Join thousands of artists who get exclusive tutorials, stencil packs, and equipment tips.</p>
          <div class="ml-embedded" data-form="d5CS8H"></div>
          <p class="about-no-spam">No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ SIGN-OFF ═══ -->
    <section class="about-signoff">
      <div class="about-inner" style="text-align:center;">
        <p>Thank you for being part of the AirbrushDOC community. Whether you're painting your first gradient or finishing your 100th commission — I'm honoured to be part of your journey.</p>
        <p class="about-signoff-closing"><strong>Now let's create something amazing.</strong></p>
        <div class="about-signoff-sig">
          <span class="about-sig-name">AirbrushDOC</span>
          <span class="about-sig-role">Founder &amp; Editor</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
/* ═══ PAGE SHELL ═══ */
.about-page { color: var(--abd-text-body); }
.about-inner { max-width: var(--abd-max-w); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; }
.about-section { padding: 72px 0; }
.about-section h2 {
  font-family: var(--abd-font-display);
  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem);
  font-weight: 800; color: var(--abd-text);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 32px;
}
.about-section h2::after {
  content: ''; display: block; width: 40px; height: 3px;
  background: var(--abd-orange); margin-top: 12px;
  border-radius: 2px;
}
.about-section p { margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.75; }
.about-accent { color: var(--abd-orange); }

/* ═══ HERO ═══ */
.about-hero {
  background: var(--abd-surface);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--abd-border);
  padding: 64px 0;
}
.about-hero-inner {
  max-width: var(--abd-max-w); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 56px;
}
.about-hero-img-wrap { flex-shrink: 0; }
.about-hero-img {
  width: 280px; height: 320px;
  border-radius: var(--abd-radius); object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
}
.about-hero-text { flex: 1; }
.about-eyebrow {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  background: var(--abd-orange-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--abd-orange-b20);
  color: var(--abd-orange); padding: 6px 14px;
  border-radius: 100px; margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.about-hero-title {
  font-family: var(--abd-font-display);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  font-weight: 800; color: var(--abd-text);
  line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.about-hero-sub {
  font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--abd-text-dim); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 520px;
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .about-hero-inner { flex-direction: column; gap: 32px; }
  .about-hero-img { width: 100%; height: 220px; }
}

/* ═══ STORY ═══ */
.about-story { background: var(--abd-bg); }
.about-story .about-inner { max-width: 760px; }
.about-quote {
  border-left: 3px solid var(--abd-orange);
  padding: 20px 24px;
  background: var(--abd-surface);
  border-radius: 0 var(--abd-radius-s) var(--abd-radius-s) 0;
  margin: 28px 0;
  font-style: italic; color: var(--abd-text-dim); line-height: 1.75;
}
.about-quote p { margin: 0; }

/* ═══ TRUST PILLARS ═══ */
.about-trust { background: var(--abd-surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--abd-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--abd-border); }
.about-pillars { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 32px; }
.about-pillar {
  background: var(--abd-surface2);
  border: 1px solid var(--abd-border);
  border-radius: var(--abd-radius);
  padding: 28px;
}
.about-pillar-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.about-pillar h3 { font-family: var(--abd-font-display); font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--abd-text); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.about-pillar p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--abd-text-dim); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.about-never { color: var(--abd-red); font-weight: 600; }
.about-will  { color: var(--abd-green); font-weight: 600; }
.about-never-will { font-size: 0.85rem; }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .about-pillars { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

/* ═══ TIMELINE ═══ */
.about-journey { background: var(--abd-bg); }
.about-timeline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
.about-tl-item {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
  gap: 24px; padding: 24px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--abd-border);
}
.about-tl-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.about-tl-year {
  font-family: var(--abd-font-display);
  font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--abd-orange); padding-top: 2px;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.about-tl-body { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--abd-text-dim); line-height: 1.7; }
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .about-tl-item { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; }
}

/* ═══ OFFERS ═══ */
.about-offers { background: var(--abd-surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--abd-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--abd-border); }
.about-offers-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
.about-offer-card {
  background: var(--abd-surface2); border: 1px solid var(--abd-border);
  border-radius: var(--abd-radius); padding: 24px;
  text-decoration: none !important; color: inherit;
  transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;
}
.about-offer-card:hover { border-color: var(--abd-orange); transform: translateY(-2px); }
.about-offer-icon { font-size: 1.8rem; }
.about-offer-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--abd-text); }
.about-offer-card p { font-size: 0.87rem; color: var(--abd-text-dim); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .about-offers-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
@media (max-width: 560px) { .about-offers-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

/* ═══ TESTIMONIALS ═══ */
.about-testimonials { background: var(--abd-bg); }
.about-testi-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
.about-testi {
  background: var(--abd-surface); border: 1px solid var(--abd-border);
  border-top: 3px solid var(--abd-orange);
  border-radius: var(--abd-radius); padding: 28px;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;
}
.about-testi p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--abd-text-dim); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0; font-style: italic; }
.about-testi cite { font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--abd-text); font-style: normal; }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .about-testi-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

/* ═══ TRANSPARENCY ═══ */
.about-transparency { background: var(--abd-surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--abd-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--abd-border); }
.about-lead { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--abd-text-dim); max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
.about-transp-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
.about-transp-item {
  background: var(--abd-surface2); border: 1px solid var(--abd-border);
  border-radius: var(--abd-radius); padding: 28px;
}
.about-transp-item h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--abd-text); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.about-transp-item p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--abd-text-dim); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.about-disclosure-link { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--abd-orange); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none !important; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--abd-orange-b20); padding-bottom: 2px; }
.about-disclosure-link:hover { border-color: var(--abd-orange); }
@media (max-width: 768px) { .about-transp-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

/* ═══ CTA ═══ */
.about-cta-section { background: var(--abd-bg); }
.about-cta-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
.about-cta-card {
  background: var(--abd-surface); border: 1px solid var(--abd-border);
  border-radius: var(--abd-radius); padding: 28px;
}
.about-cta-card h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--abd-text); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.about-cta-card ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.about-cta-card li::before { content: '→ '; color: var(--abd-orange); font-weight: 700; }
.about-cta-card a { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--abd-text-dim); text-decoration: none !important; transition: color 0.2s; }
.about-cta-card a:hover { color: var(--abd-orange); }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .about-cta-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

/* ═══ CONTACT ═══ */
.about-contact { background: var(--abd-surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--abd-border); }
.about-contact-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 56px; align-items: start; }
.about-contact-left h2, .about-contact-right h2 { font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem); }
.about-contact-detail {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  margin: 20px 0 8px; color: var(--abd-text-dim);
}
.about-contact-detail a { color: var(--abd-orange); font-weight: 600; }
.about-response { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--abd-text-muted); }
.about-no-spam { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--abd-text-muted); margin-top: 12px; }
@media (max-width: 768px) { .about-contact-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; } }

/* ═══ SIGN-OFF ═══ */
.about-signoff {
  padding: 56px 0;
  background: var(--abd-bg);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--abd-border);
}
.about-signoff p { color: var(--abd-text-dim); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 16px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
.about-signoff-closing { color: var(--abd-text) !important; font-size: 1.05rem !important; }
.about-signoff-sig { margin-top: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
.about-sig-name { font-family: var(--abd-font-display); font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--abd-orange); }
.about-sig-role { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--abd-text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
</style>
